       Ordinal 9700 puts this below Vixy_ShowMakersMark at 9800 and Vixy_AskName at 10000, and above
       vanilla's water ritual at 980 and [begin trade] at 990 - a thing you ask a tinker about after
       greeting them and before doing business.

       The teaching part carries no fields: which recipe it grants is the subclass, because
